        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The last great human settlement exists within an unforgiving, infected world. Exceptional agility and combat skills make you a powerful ally and a valuable commodity. With your unique abilities you have the power to be an agent of change within this decaying metropolis. Use it wisely.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
